{"content":"\n<p>Regarded as the draft of the Taj Mahal, Tomb of I’timad-ud-Daulah in Agra is aptly called the ‘Jewel Box’ or the ‘Bachcha Taj’</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img width=\"736\" height=\"414\" src=\"http://penakkal.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/103763839_109560600792732_6618438272369545539_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure>\n","quranRefs":[],"hadithRefs":[],"lang":"ta","wordCount":24,"coverSourceUrl":"http://penakkal.local/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/104081372_109560344126091_5460696482933747379_n.jpg"}